  id: S-09
  lines:
  - speaker: "F\u0131r\u0131nc\u0131 Zehra"
    text: "Simit\xE7i Hatice'ye de s\xF6yledim, gaz az olursa alev sar\u0131 yanar."
  - speaker: "A\u015F\xE7\u0131 Melek"
    text: "Benimki hep sar\u0131yd\u0131, ben onu g\xFCzel san\u0131yordum!"
  - speaker: "F\u0131r\u0131nc\u0131 Zehra"
    text: "G\xFCzel ama isli. Mavisi do\u011Frusu."
